# PE taxonomy columns (BTC Product Data)

Source: **BTC Product Data** (live: `database/shared/btc_product_data/BTC_Product_Data.csv`; same role as Uneek Product Data). Join: Supplier SKU → BTC UID, else Custom Label numeric suffix.

| DB column | PE column | Format | First fill | After PE corrections |
|-----------|-----------|--------|------------|----------------------|
| `Category` | `Department` | Title case | Blank only | **Overwrite** from new PE |
| `Sub-Category` | `Sub Department` | Title case | Blank only | **Overwrite** from new PE |
| `Department` | `Department` | Title case | Blank only | **Overwrite** from new PE |
| `Sub-Department` | `Sub Department` | Title case | Blank only | **Overwrite** from new PE |
| `Brand` | `Brand` | PE as-is | Blank only | Stay blank-only unless asked |

Some PE Department / Sub Department rows are wrong. When the supervisor corrects them on the product worksheet, replace the matching live-DB cells (all four taxonomy columns). Do not leave stale values just because they are already filled.

```text
python scripts/fill_from_seeds.py --steps sku,pe --overwrite-pe-taxonomy --dry-run
```

`Tags` and `Size (Dimensions)` stay unfilled unless asked.
